	(text "ICM-45686 on SPI1 with a 32 kHz CLKIN from TIM2_CH3 (PX4: icm45686 -C 32000), BMI088 on SPI2 (different vendor, own bus).\nBMP581 on I2C4 at 0x47. All sensors on +3V3_SENS, which the MCU can power-cycle.\nHeater: 4 x 120R around the IMUs, AO3400A on TIM17_CH1 (PX4 heater driver holds IMU temperature)."
